              "id": "081c6279-e71a-4a87-9264-1d1902929eef",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>The SAGE Dictionary of Leisure Studies</strong></em> was written by Tony Blackshaw &amp; Garry Crawford, published by SAGE Publications Ltd, November 25, 2009."
            },
            {
              "id": "537e4e52-04a7-44bb-862b-cb7da58fe80e",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "09d411ad-2aa7-4fbd-bffb-ef7e46085e2d",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>This is the first full length dictionary of Leisure Studies. It examines the key concepts, assesses the work of central figures, and helps students zero-in on essential issues and conceptual distinctions.</em>"
            },
